@startuml ui-programmatic-input-data-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activityFontSize 12

title 筷子输入法 - 程序化输入数据流\nProgrammatic Input Data Flow

|InputActionScript|
start
:坐标无关的动作脚本;

|InputActionPlayer|
:executeAction(InputAction);

:查询 InputActionPositionResolver.resolve(key)
→ ComposeInputActionPositionResolver
→ 从 ViewModel 布局状态缓存读取
→ 返回归一化坐标 OffsetF;

:InputActionPathInterpolator
生成归一化坐标插值路径;

:写入 GestureFeedbackState (归一化坐标);

|GestureFeedbackState|
fork
  :fingerIndicator: InputActionFingerIndicator
(归一化坐标 + clickAnimation);
fork again
  :touchTrailPoints: List<OffsetF>
(含插值轨迹，归一化坐标);
fork again
  :pressedKeys: Set<InputKey>;
end fork

|GestureFeedbackPanel|
:反归一化: OffsetF × panelSize → Offset;
:绘制手指指示器 + 点击涟漪动画
绘制触摸轨迹、按键高亮;

|InputActionPlayer|
:row1IndicatorState → InputActionFingerIndicator;

|CandidateListPanel|
:showIndicator=true
indicatorState=row1Indicator
反归一化绘制圆形点击指示器;

|InputActionPlayer|
:row2IndicatorState → InputActionFingerIndicator;

|InputListPanel / ToolListPanel|
:showIndicator=true
indicatorState=row2Indicator
反归一化绘制圆形点击指示器;

|KeyboardViewModel|
:handleIntent(ImeIntent)
(Animation 模式不提交到编辑器);

|ImeEngine|
:reduce() → ImeState;

|Compose UI|
:StateFlow 驱动各面板重组;

stop

legend right
    |= 颜色 |= 含义 |
    |<#E8F5E9>| :ime-ui 层 |
    |<#FFF3E0>| :ime-engine 层 |
endlegend

@enduml
